"child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == 'F' else 'Er'} lebt auf dem gleichen Kontinent wie ${firstname}.\n"
"\t% else:\n"
"Heute möchten wir ${dir} ${alumni_name}, ehemalige Patenkinder von Compassion, vorstellen. Sie leben auf den gleichen "
"Kontinenten wie ${firstname}.\n"
"% endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>${'Schaut euch' if plural else 'Schau dir'}\n"
"    % if multi_link:\n"
"ihre Geschichten an: <a href=\"${alumni_link}\">${alumni_link}</a>\n"
"        % else:\n"
"die Geschichte von ${alumni_name} an: <a href=\"${alumni_link}\">${alumni_link}</a>\n"
"    % endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Liebe Grüsse<br/>\n"
"Sarah<br/>\n"
"Tel: +41 (0)31 552 21 21<br/>\n"
"Fragen? <a href=\"${chat_url}\">${chat_url}</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set child = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set plural = partner.title.plural or partner.title.id == 29\n"
"    % set firstname = sponsorships.mapped('child_id').get_list('preferred_name', 3, 'tes filleuls', False)\n"
"    % set country = child.mapped('field_office_id')\n"
"% set alumni_name = country.get_list('alumni_representative')\n"
"% set alumni_link = country.get_list('alumni_video_link', 1, 'https://vimeo.com/showcase/histoires-danciens-filleuls-de-"
"compassion')\n"
"% set multi_link = alumni_link == 'https://vimeo.com/showcase/histoires-danciens-filleuls-de-compassion'\n"
"% set my_url = \"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/my/home\" if partner.user_ids.login_date else partner.signup_url\n"
"% set chat_url = \"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3\"\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"${partner.informal_salutation}\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Que signifie la pauvreté dans la vie de ${'ton filleul' if len(child) == 1 else 'tes filleuls'}?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Les causes et les effets de la pauvreté sont multiples. Elles varient en fonction du contexte.\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"  % if not multi_link:\n"
"Aujourd'hui, nous souhaitons te présenter ${alumni_name}, ${\"une ancienne enfant parrainée\" if "
"child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == 'F'  else \"un ancien enfant parrainé\"} de Compassion. ${'Elle' if "
"child[0].field_office_id.alumni_gender == 'F' else 'Il'} vit sur le même continent que ${firstname}.\n"
"\t% else:\n"
"Aujourd'hui, nous souhaitons te présenter ${alumni_name}, des anciens enfants parrainés de Compassion. Ils vivent sur "
"les mêmes continents que ${firstname}.\n"
"% endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Regarde\n"
"    % if multi_link:\n"
"leurs histoires: <a href=\"${alumni_link}\">${alumni_link}</a>\n"
"        % else:\n"
"l'histoire de ${alumni_name}: <a href=\"${alumni_link}\">${alumni_link}</a>\n"
"    % endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Bonne journée et à bientôt!\n"
"<br/>L'équipe de Compassion\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"<br/>Des questions? <a href=\"${chat_url}\">${chat_url}</a>\n"
"</p>"

