#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_1_year
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', 3, translate=False)\n"
"    % set payer = sum(sponsorships.mapped('total_amount')) and partner in sponsorships.mapped('partner_id')\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.salutation}\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Congratulations, it's been a year since you became the sponsor of ${firstname}!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>A sponsorship is a long-term investment in the life of a child. To learn more, click here: <a href=\"https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eB-8APGpGo\">video</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for being a part of this mission!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>A Write&amp;Pray sponsorship is a team effort between you and a donor.\n"
"    % if payer:\n"
"    If you would like to increase your financial support,\n"
"    % else:\n"
"    If you would like to take on CHF 2/5/10 of the financial support yourself,\n"
"    % endif\n"
"    you can do so here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">mycompassion</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>The team of Compassion</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set children = object.get_objects().mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', 3, translate=False)\n"
"    % set wp_tchat_url = \"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3\"\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.informal_salutation},\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Félicitations, cela fait un an que tu parraines ${firstname}!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Un parrainage est un investissement à long terme dans la vie d'un enfant. Pour en savoir plus, clique ici: <a "
"href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0eB-8APGpGo\">video</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci de faire partie de cette mission!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Un parrainage Write&Pray est un effort d'équipe entre un donateur et toi. Si tu souhaites prendre en charge toi-même "
"CHF 2.-/5.-/10.- du soutien financier (ou si tu souhaites augmenter ton soutien financier), tu peux le faire ici: <a "
"href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">mycompassion</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Bonne journée et à bientôt!</p>\n"
"<p>L'équipe de Compassion\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"<br/>Des questions? Tchate avec nous sur MyCompassion: <a href=\"${wp_tchat_url}\">${wp_tchat_url}</a>\n"
"</p>"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_contribution_reminder_mail
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\n"
"    % set number_reminder = object.search_count([('config_id','=',object.config_id.id),('partner_id','=',partner.id),"
"('state','=','done),('object_ids','like',sponsorships.ids[:1]),('id','!=',object.id)])\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.salutation}\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately, we have not yet received a donation from you for the contribution of the sponsorship that you would "
"like to pay yourself.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"% if number_reminder:\n"
"This is already the ${\"second\" if number_reminder == 1 else \"third\"} time that we have contacted you about this. "
"Thank you for taking care of this quickly.\n"
"% else:\n"
"Thank you for taking care of this quickly: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donation\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"% endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Can you not take care of this part yourself? Then contact us so that we can find another donor for it.\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\n"
"    % set number_reminder = object.search_count([('config_id','=',object.config_id.id),('partner_id','=',partner.id),"
"('state','=','done'),('object_ids','like',sponsorships.ids[:1]),('id','!=',object.id)])\n"
"% set wp_tchat_url = \"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3\"\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.informal_salutation},\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Pour info, nous n'avons pas encore reçu de don de ta part pour la partie du parrainage que tu aimerais payer toi-même."
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"% if number_reminder:\n"
"Ceci est déjà la ${\"deuxième\" if number_reminder == 1 else \"troisième\"} fois que nous te le rappelons. Merci "
"d'avance d'effectuer le paiement au plus vite.\n"
"% else:\n"
"Peux-tu effectuer le paiement au plus vite? <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donation\">MyCompassion</a>.\n"
"% endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Tu n'es pas en mesure de payer cette partie toi-même? Prends contact avec nous, pour que nous puissions trouver un "
"autre donateur.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>L'équipe de Compassion\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"<br/>Des questions? Tchate avec nous sur MyCompassion: <a href=\"${wp_tchat_url}\">${wp_tchat_url}</a>\n"
"</p>"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
