"% if not lsv_dd:\n"
"<p>In order for you to ${\"increase\" if payer else \"set up\"} your donation for the sponsorship,\n"
"you can find the payment slip here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Download payment "
"slip</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"% endif\n"
"    <p>Your feedback on the Write &amp; Pray sponsorship is important to us. It takes about 1 minute. Thank you for "
"filling it out: <a href=\"${survey}\">Link to survey</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"% if object.send_mode == \"sms\":\n"
"<p>We will communicate with you by email instead of SMS.\n"
"    % if not partner.email:\n"
"Thank you for communicating your email address as soon as possible.\n"
"    % endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"% endif\n"
"% if object.send_mode == \"digital\":\n"
"    ${object.user_id.signature | safe}\n"
"% endif\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set amount = sponsorships.mapped(\"group_id\")[:1].get_amount(\"2200-01-01\",\"2200-02-01\", sponsorships)\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', 3, translate=False)\n"
"    % set payment_mode = sponsorships.mapped('payment_mode_id.name')[0]\n"
"    % set lsv_dd = 'LSV' in payment_mode or 'Postfinance' in payment_mode\n"
"    % set survey = object.env.ref('partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_journey_survey').public_url\n"
"    % set wp_tchat_url = \"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3\"\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.informal_salutation},\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Wouaw, nous sommes très reconnaissants que tu veuilles prendre en charge le soutien financier de ${firstname}. Merci "
"beaucoup!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"    % if not lsv_dd:\n"
"        <p>\n"
"            Pour que tu puisses mettre en place/augmenter ton don pour ton filleul, tu trouveras le bulletin de "
"versement ici: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/download/sponsorship_bvr\">Télécharger le bulletin</a>.\n"
"        </p>\n"
"    % endif\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Nous communiquerons avec toi par e-mail plutôt que par SMS. Merci de nous communiquer ton adresse e-mail au plus "
"vite.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Ton feedback sur le parrainage Write&Pray est très important. Merci de prendre 1 minute pour le remplir: <a href=\"$"
"{survey}\">questionnaire</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci beaucoup, bonne journée et à bientôt!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    L'équipe de Compassion<br/>\n"
"    Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\n"
"    % set reminder = object.search([(\"config_id\", \"=\", object.config_id.id), (\"partner_id\", \"=\", partner.id), "
"(\"state\", \"=\", \"done\")])\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.salutation}\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>This year you will turn 25, congratulations!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for supporting ${firstname} with a Write&amp;Pray sponsorship for ${sponsorships[:1].contract_duration//365 "
"or 1} years.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Our Write&amp;Pray sponsorships are for young people under the age of 25. Most sponsors have the financial means to "
"fully resume a sponsorship after that.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>It would be great if you would continue to sponsor ${firstname} for CHF 42.00 per month, so that together we can "
"continue to free children from poverty. You can choose to do so here: <a href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/"
"donations\">link</a>\n"
"% if reminder:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>If we do not receive any feedback from you within the next two weeks, we will unfortunately have to terminate the "
"sponsorship and look for a new sponsor for ${firstname}.\n"
"% endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Have a good day and see you soon!</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\n"
"    % set reminder = object.search_count([(\"config_id\", \"=\", object.config_id.id), (\"partner_id\", \"=\", "
"partner.id), (\"state\", \"=\", \"done\")])\n"
"% set wp_tchat_url = \"https://mycompassion.ch/fr_CH/im_livechat/support/3\"\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.informal_salutation},\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Cette année, tu auras 25 ans. Félicitations!\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci d’avoir parrainé ${firstname} pendant ${sponsorships[:1].contract_duration//365 or 1} années avec un parrainage "
"Write&Pray.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Nos parrainages Write&Pray sont destinés aux jeunes de moins de 25 ans. La plupart des parrains ont les moyens "
"financiers de reprendre complètement un parrainage après cela. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Ce serait formidable si tu continuais à parrainer ${firstname} pour CHF 42.- par mois. Tu peux le faire ici: <a "
"href=\"https://mycompassion.ch/my/donations\">link</a>\n"
"% if reminder:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Sans réponse de ta part dans les deux prochaines semaines, nous devrons malheureusement mettre fin au parrainage et "
"chercher un nouveau parrain pour ${firstname}.\n"
"% endif\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Bonne journée et à bientôt!</p>\n"
"<p>L'équipe de Compassion\n"
"<br/>Tel: +41 (0)24 434 21 24\n"
"<br/>Des questions? Tchate avec nous sur MyCompassion: <a href=\"${wp_tchat_url}\">${wp_tchat_url}</a>\n"
"</p>"

#. module: partner_communication_switzerland
#: model:mail.template,body_html:partner_communication_switzerland.wrpr_transformation_complete
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.salutation}\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Thank you for deciding to support the sponsorship of ${firstname} financially.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>There is one more thing you can do: Would you take a few minutes to give one or two other teens the opportunity to "
"join the fight against extreme poverty?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Tell them about your experience as a Write &amp; Pray sponsor and encourage them to do the same.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Together, we can accomplish much more: <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/writeandpray/\">Write&amp;Pray</a>\n"
"</p><p>\n"
"            Thank you so much!\n"
"    ${object.user_id.signature | safe}\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"    % set partner = object.partner_id\n"
"    % set sponsorships = object.get_objects()\n"
"    % set children = sponsorships.mapped('child_id')\n"
"    % set firstname = children.get_list('preferred_name', translate=False)\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    ${partner.informal_salutation},\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Merci d’avoir décidé de soutenir désormais aussi financièrement le parrainage de ${firstname}.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Ta mission Write & Pray n’est cependant pas terminée. Peux-tu prendre quelques minutes pour offrir à un autre jeune "
"adulte ou ado, la possibilité de prendre part à la lutte contre l’extrême pauvreté?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Explique-lui ton expérience de parrain/marraine Write & Pray et encourage-le/la à t’imiter.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Ensemble, nous pouvons multiplier notre impact et augmenter davantage encore le nombre d’enfants libérés de l’extrême "
"pauvreté. <a href=\"https://compassion.ch/writeandpray/\">Write&amp;Pray</a>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"    Merci de tout cœur et a bientôt.<br>\n"
"    ${object.user_id.signature | safe}\n"
"</p>\n"
"        "

