"<p>\n"
"   ${object.partner_id.salutation},\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   We understand and acknowledge  you have decided not to take over a new sponsorship at this time.\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   Thank you for your past investment in the life of a child living in poverty.  More than 70 years of experience "
"assures us that this commitment produces sustainable results. ${object.success_sentence or ''}\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   If you have set up an automatic payment order for your sponsorship, please cancel it.\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   Did you know that you can also help children in poverty by giving them access to drinking water (water filters, "
"toilet installations, hygiene awareness)? With a one-time gift or regular donations of CHF 10, 20 or 30 per month - you "
"can make a big difference.\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   If you are interested, please call us at 031 552 21 25 or you can also donate online on www.compassion.ch/spenden\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   Thank you again for your generosity so far.\n"
"% if object.send_mode == 'digital':\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   <br>\n"
"   Best regards,\n"
"   <br>\n"
